cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "switchyard: The shared MCP proxy core for OpenAstra runtime tools"
abstract: >-
  switchyard is a Go library that proxies Model Context Protocol traffic
  transparently and lets tools plug in per-call hooks to observe, delay,
  block, answer or rewrite tool calls, with per-session state and versioned
  JSONL traces.
authors:
  - family-names: Sadayamuthu
    given-names: Karthikeyan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3539-6048"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sadayamuthu/switchyard"
url: "https://openastra.org"
keywords:
  - MCP
  - proxy
  - AI agents
  - Go
  - security tooling
